    "title": "Carbondale man facing first-degree murder after turning himself in to police - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Elaina Seidelman ,\n12 hours ago\nCARBONDALE, Ill. (Heartland News) - A Carbondale, Illinois man was arrested and charged with murder after he turned himself in to police on Thursday afternoon, November 5. According to the Carbondale Police Department, 39-year-old James Harris told police he was responsible for the death of a woman he was living with.\nRead full article\nAdd to Preferred Sources\n4",
